    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on crafting and character development, featuring a wide range of academic schools, book chapters, equipment, gems (to be introduced later), and rich character attributes. It will have a &quot;grinding&quot; feel to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, players, please consider your personal preferences before purchasing!<br>So, players, please consider your personal preferences before purchasing!<br>So, players, please consider your personal preferences before purchasing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Important things must be said three times :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Heroes Of ChunQiu&quot;</strong> is a text-based idle game that encompasses a rich variety of academic schools, book chapters, items, and an equipment crafting system. Players can cultivate a single character, gather materials to craft equipment, configure academic schools, and explore book chapters to build their unique hero!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super easy-to-follow gameplay + a complex and diverse skill/item/equipment system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly customizable equipment forging system: Combine a plethora of rare and magical affixes. Through reforging, enchanting, and crafting, players can create equipment tailored to their combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchanting, reforging, and crafting systems allow players to customize adventure gear that fits their tactical needs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of gem socketing options will be introduced in the future!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden across 10 major maps, various figures from the Spring and Autumn period await players to defeat in creative ways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, players can enter the endless battlefield to earn merits, study book chapters, and even elevate their noble rank to enhance their adventurer's abilities!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer's Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on crafting and character development, featuring a wide range of academic schools, book chapters, equipment, gems (to be introduced later), and rich character attributes. It will have a &quot;grinding&quot; feel to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, players, please consider your personal preferences before purchasing!<br>So, players, please consider your personal preferences before purchasing!<br>So, players, please consider your personal preferences before purchasing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Important things must be said three times :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Heroes Of ChunQiu&quot;</strong> is a text-based idle game that encompasses a rich variety of academic schools, book chapters, items, and an equipment crafting system. Players can cultivate a single character, gather materials to craft equipment, configure academic schools, and explore book chapters to build their unique hero!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super easy-to-follow gameplay + a complex and diverse skill/item/equipment system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly customizable equipment forging system: Combine a plethora of rare and magical affixes. Through reforging, enchanting, and crafting, players can create equipment tailored to their combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchanting, reforging, and crafting systems allow players to customize adventure gear that fits their tactical needs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of gem socketing options will be introduced in the future!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden across 10 major maps, various figures from the Spring and Autumn period await players to defeat in creative ways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, players can enter the endless battlefield to earn merits, study book chapters, and even elevate their noble rank to enhance their adventurer's abilities!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u300a\u6625\u79cb\uff1a\u82f1\u96c4\u300b\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u6302\u673a\u6587\u5b57\u6e38\u620f\uff0c\u6709\u7740\u4e30\u5bcc\u7684\u88c5\u5907\u6253\u9020\u7cfb\u7edf\u548c\u5355\u89d2\u8272\u517b\u6210\u3002\u5728\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\uff0c\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u4eab\u53d7\u6302\u673a\u81ea\u52a8\u6218\u6597\u7684\u4fbf\u5229\uff0c\u8f7b\u677e\u79ef\u7d2f\u8d44\u6e90\uff0c\u4e0d\u65ad\u63d0\u5347\u4f60\u7684\u82f1\u96c4\u5b9e\u529b\u3002\u901a\u8fc7\u6536\u96c6\u7a00\u6709\u6750\u6599\uff0c\u5206\u89e3\u953b\u9020\uff0c\u6253\u9020\u51fa\u72ec\u4e00\u65e0\u4e8c\u7684\u88c5\u5907\u3002\u6e38\u620f\u80cc\u666f\u8bbe\u5b9a\u5728\u6625\u79cb\u65f6\u671f\u3002\u300a\u6625\u79cb\uff1a\u82f1\u96c4\u300b\u4e0d\u4ec5\u9002\u5408\u4f11\u95f2\u73a9\u5bb6\u8f7b\u677e\u6302\u673a\uff0c\u4e5f\u6ee1\u8db3\u6df1\u5ea6\u73a9\u5bb6\u5bf9\u7b56\u7565\u548c\u517b\u6210\u7684\u8ffd\u6c42\u3002",
